      "created_at": "2025-08-30T06:51:40.462Z",
      "cooked": "<p>no need for any scripts in display on field add this condition</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">eval:doc.company == \"company A\"\n</code></pre>\n<p>then when that company is selected the fields will show up<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/2/b29444db4ad527d85a5af4aee814ee8cdf13dffb.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b29444db4ad527d85a5af4aee814ee8cdf13dffb\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b29444db4ad527d85a5af4aee814ee8cdf13dffb_2_690x132.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ptMEA4wJT5ZlLqapDv7G5QzYw1J\" width=\"690\" height=\"132\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b29444db4ad527d85a5af4aee814ee8cdf13dffb_2_690x132.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/2/b29444db4ad527d85a5af4aee814ee8cdf13dffb.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/2/b29444db4ad527d85a5af4aee814ee8cdf13dffb.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F1F1F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">901×173 10.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
